From 65a28d4df444a213923d3fb7b2d5ffadf59c55f3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keith Packard <keithp@keithp.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 08:13:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 14/15] test-posix: Check <fenv.h>

test-fenv_h checks the exception and rounding macros, FE_DFL_ENV and
the prototypes; test-fenv_h-names that strict POSIX sees no extension
and that the header survives macros named like its parameters.
test-feupdateenv checks the startup environment, the flag functions,
fesetround's rejection of bad modes, what each rounding mode does to
float, double and long double arithmetic, sqrt, fma, rint, nearbyint,
lrint and llrint, and fegetenv, fesetenv, FE_DFL_ENV, feholdexcept
and feupdateenv.

Signed-off-by: Keith Packard <keithp@keithp.com>
---
